        },
        {
          "text": " Naiyapoo ituŋanan aiyaposit mama ejai EJAKAIT, arai naisumunio aisumunet ajen eketau kaenet, sirikinyei aitodol akekirot; iswamai kwape ejaatar akiro kere nuelomunete kaitukuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naiyapoo aberu aiyaposit mama ejai EJAKAIT, koenikini da bon kaenet, koroko ejai okale loka papake, koiditeuke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepupu papake aiyapositike, ka aeneteke naeenitor eketau, kosodi papake aililiŋikin ŋes: iburai do akeiyaposio kere aitodolio: ka ŋinienet naeenitor ŋesi eketau iburai aitodolio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye arai keneroki ŋes papake kapaaran naepupunio; epalunio aiyaposioke kere, ka aeneta kere nueenitor ŋesi eketau: isionie da EJAKAIT ŋes, naarai abu papake koneroki ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye arai emanyit ŋes ekiliokit, kojaas aiyaposioke mamake, arai aisud einer kaitukuke, nueenitor ŋesi eketau; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepupu okilenike, kosodi aililiŋikin ŋes kapaaran naepupunio: iburai do akeiyaposio aitodolio, ka aenetake nueenitor ŋesi eketau iburai aitodolio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
